  * Inputs:
      * eqs, a *note hash table: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable,, indicating the
        equations/inequations of each node
      * ranks, a *note hash table: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable,, indicating the
        rank of each node
      * tree, an instance of the type *note ElimTree: ElimTree,, 
      * DG, a *note digraph: (Graphs)Digraph,, whose vertices are labels
        (strings) of the nodes
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note ChordalNet: ChordalNet,, 

Description
===========

This method constructs a chordal network from the digraph of its nodes.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a,b,c,d,MonomialOrder=>Lex];                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : DG = digraph {{"a0","b0"}, {"a0","b1"}, {"a1","b2"}, {"b0","c1"},       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = Digraph{a0 => {b0, b1}}                                                 |
|             a1 => {b2}                                                      |
|             b0 => {c1}                                                      |
|             b1 => {c0}                                                      |
|             b2 => {c0}                                                      |
|             c0 => {d0}                                                      |
|             c1 => {d1}                                                      |
|             d0 => {}                                                        |
|             d1 => {}                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Digraph                                                                 |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{"b1","c0"}, {"b2","c0"}, {"c0","d0"}, {"c1","d1"}}                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : G = chordalGraph digraph hashTable{a=>{b,c},b=>{c},c=>{d},d=>{}};       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : tree = elimTree G                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = ElimTree{a => c}                                                        |
|              b => c                                                         |
|              c => d                                                         |
|              d => b                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : ElimTree                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : rnk = hashTable{"a0"=>a, "a1"=>a, "b0"=>b, "b1"=>b, "b2"=>b,            |
|                     "c0"=>c, "d0"=>d, "c1"=>c, "d1"=>d};                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : eqs = hashTable{"a0" => ({a},{}), "a1" => ({},{}),                      |
|                     "b0" => ({b},{}), "b1" => ({},{}), "b2" => ({b},{}),    |
|                     "c0" => ({c},{}), "c1" => ({},{}),                      |
|                     "d0" => ({},{}), "d1" => ({d},{}) };                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : chordalNet(eqs,rnk,tree,DG)                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = ChordalNet{ a => {a,  }    }                                            |
|                 c => { , c}                                                 |
|                 d => { , d}                                                 |
|                 b => {b,  , b}                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : ChordalNet                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+


