    -- iterates over the chains of a chordal network
  * "nextChain(ChordalNetChain,Sequence,ZZ,ChordalNet)" -- see *note nextChain:
    nextChain, -- iterates over the chains of a chordal network
  * "nextChain(ZZ,ChordalNet)" -- see *note nextChain: nextChain, -- iterates
    over the chains of a chordal network

