chromaticIdeal -- chromatic ideal of a graph
********************************************

  * Usage: 
        chromaticIdeal(kk,G,q)
  * Inputs:
      * kk, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, 
      * G, a *note graph: (Graphs)Graph,, 
