equations $x_i^q -1, i \in V$ and $(x_i^q-x_j^q)/(x_i-x_j), ij\in E$.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : G = cycleGraph 4;                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = chromaticIdeal(QQ, G, 3)                                            |
|                                                                             |
|             2          2   2          2   2          2   2          2   3   |
|o2 = ideal (a  + a*b + b , a  + a*d + d , b  + b*c + c , c  + c*d + d , a  - |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|         3       3       3                                                   |
|     1, b  - 1, c  - 1, d  - 1)                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Ideal of QQ[a..d]                                                       |
