|i2 : N = chordalNet I;                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : chordalTria N;                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : codimCount N                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|      7     6      5     4                                                   |
|o4 = t  + 8t  + 13t  + 2t                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : ZZ[t]                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : components(N,1)                                                         |
|                                                                             |
