|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|ideal (x , x , x , x , x ), ideal (x , x , x , x , x ), ideal (x , x , x ,   |
|        1   2   4   5   7           2   4   5   7   8           2   3   5    |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|x , x ), ideal (x , x , x , x , x ), ideal (x , x , x , x , x ), ideal (x ,  |
| 7   8           2   3   5   6   8           1   3   5   6   8           1   |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                }                                                            |
