digraph(ChordalNet) -- digraph associated to a chordal network
**************************************************************

  * Function: *note digraph: (Graphs)digraph,
  * Usage: 
        digraph N
  * Inputs:
      * N, an instance of the type *note ChordalNet: ChordalNet,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * EntryMode (missing documentation) => ..., default value "auto", 
      * Singletons (missing documentation) => ..., default value null, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note digraph: (Graphs)Digraph,, 

Description
===========

Returns the digraph associated to a chordal network. The vertices of this
digraph are given by the *note labels: ChordalNetNode, of the nodes.

+--------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a,b,c,d,MonomialOrder=>Lex];          |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = ideal {a*b, a*c, b*c, c*d};              |
|                                                  |
|o2 : Ideal of R                                   |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : N = chordalNet I;                            |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : chordalTria N;                               |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : reduceNet N;                                 |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : N                                            |
|                                                  |
|o6 = ChordalNet{ a => {a,  }    }                 |
|                 b => {b,  , b}                   |
|                 c => {c,  }                      |
|                 d => { , d}                      |
|                                                  |
|o6 : ChordalNet                                   |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : nodes N / (Ni -> label Ni)                   |
|                                                  |
|o7 = {a_0, a_1, b_0, b_1, b_2, c_0, c_1, d_0, d_1}|
|                                                  |
|o7 : List                                         |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : digraph N                                    |
|                                                  |
|o8 = Digraph{a_0 => {b_0, b_1}}                   |
|             a_1 => {b_2}                         |
|             b_0 => {c_1}                         |
|             b_1 => {c_0}                         |
|             b_2 => {c_0}                         |
|             c_0 => {d_0}                         |
|             c_1 => {d_1}                         |
|             d_0 => {}                            |
|             d_1 => {}                            |
|                                                  |
|o8 : Digraph                                      |
+--------------------------------------------------+


