  * "elimTree(ChordalGraph)" -- see *note elimTree: elimTree, -- elimination
    tree of a chordal graph
  * elimTree(List,HashTable,HashTable) (missing documentation)
  * "RingMap ElimTree" -- see *note RingMap ChordalNet: RingMap ChordalNet, --
    apply ring map to a chordal network

