    displayGraph_lpString_cmString_cmElimTree_rp, -- displays an elimination
    tree using Graphviz
  * *note displayGraph(String,String,ElimTree):
    displayGraph_lpString_cmString_cmElimTree_rp, -- displays an elimination
    tree using Graphviz
  * "chordalGraph(ElimTree)"
